  f(f(y, Y), f(f(f(f(f(y, Y), Z), Z), f(f(Z, f(y, Y)), f(f(y, Y), W))), V))
= { by lemma 17 }
  f(f(y, Y), f(f(f(f(y, Y), Z), Z), f(f(Z, f(y, Y)), f(f(y, Y), W))))
= { by lemma 15 }
  f(y, Y)
= { by lemma 20 }
  y
% SZS output end Proof

RESULT: Theorem (the conjecture is true).
